elerated since 2012\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Because RCV first became available in high-income countries, the World Bank income groupings for 2020 were used to evaluate national income-related disparities.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"Coverage estimates for RCVs are determined by WHO and UNICEF estimates of national immunization coverage.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}